# settings e2e: the full reference-backed flow — L1 home (+scroll),
# Personalization L2, Colors (radio + swatch), Sounds (toggle + checkbox),
# Start (preview + flyout shard), System L2, Display (slider + toggle),
# About (value rows + Edit name flow with the shared SIP), USB toggles,
# Update & security L2, Active hours (+ hour picker), and the search flow.
# Keyboard key centres (docked 40px up): row0 y302 (q17 w49 e81 r113 t145
# y177 u209 i241 o273 p305), row1 y355 (a33 s65 d97 f129 g161 h193 j225 k257
# l289), row2 y408 (shift24 z65 x97 c129 v161 b193 n225 m257 bksp297),
# row3 y462 (space177 period258 enter297).
# Home rows (top 104, pitch 64): System116 Devices180 Network244
# Personalization308 Accounts372 Time436. L2 rows (top 128, pitch 48):
# row0 128 row1 176 row2 224 row3 272 row4 320.
# Navbar (SHELLCHROME): back32 home160 search288 @ y508.
shot boot
# scroll the category list all the way down (clamped = deterministic),
# then back up
drag 160 460 160 60
shot home-scrolled
drag 160 100 160 460
# Personalization L2 (row 4)
tap 160 308
shot personalization
# Colors (L2 row 1 at 176): Light radio + pick a swatch in row 2
tap 160 200
tap 60 140
tap 152 254
shot colors
# back to the category, Sounds (L2 row 2): Vibrate off, checkbox off
key 0x1b
tap 160 248
shot sounds
tap 30 204
tap 160 304
shot sounds-set
# back, Start (L2 row 0): tile preview + background flyout
key 0x1b
tap 160 150
shot start
tap 160 336
shot start-flyout
tap 160 354
shot start-picked
# System L2 (home row 1) -> Display (row 0)
key 0x1b
key 0x1b
tap 160 116
shot system
tap 160 150
shot display
# brightness slider to ~75%, auto-brightness toggle off
tap 230 106
tap 30 214
shot display-set
# back, About (row 4): value rows + Edit name
key 0x1b
tap 160 344
shot about
tap 60 136
shot editname
# backspace x12 to clear, then type "My": shift, m, y
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 297 408
tap 24 408
tap 257 408
tap 177 302
shot editname-typed
tap 90 146
shot about-renamed
# back out, Devices -> USB (row 1): both toggles on
key 0x1b
key 0x1b
tap 160 180
tap 160 176
shot usb
tap 30 226
tap 30 334
shot usb-on
# Update & security (row 8 renders at ~304 at max scroll) -> Active hours
key 0x1b
key 0x1b
drag 160 460 160 60
tap 160 304
shot update
tap 160 176
shot activehours
# start-time hour cell (box ~251..285, hour column x<116)
tap 60 262
shot picker
tap 80 438
shot activehours-set
# search flow: home, search box, type "te", accept the "test" suggestion
key 0x1b
key 0x1b
tap 160 75
shot search
tap 145 302
tap 81 302
shot search-te
tap 160 150
shot search-accepted
# back home via the navbar Home key
tap 160 508
shot home-final
